<P class="t1 on">通知公告 <SPAN class="line"></SPAN></P>
<DIV class="clear"></DIV></DIV>
<DIV class="nry_con">
<DIV class="con">
<P class="tit">2023年校级高等教育教学成果奖评审结果公示</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2023-11-23&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 13012)</script>)</SPAN></P>
         <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:等线;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@等线";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoHeader, li.MsoHeader, div.MsoHeader {mso-style-link:"页眉 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; vsb_temp-mode:char; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoFooter, li.MsoFooter, div.MsoFooter {mso-style-link:"页脚 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; vsb_temp-mode:char; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoDate, li.MsoDate, div.MsoDate {mso-style-link:"日期 Char"; margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:5.0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"日期 Char"; mso-style-link:日期;} span.Char0 {mso-style-name:"页眉 Char"; mso-style-link:页眉;} span.Char1 {mso-style-name:"页脚 Char"; mso-style-link:页脚;} .MsoChpDefault {font-size:10.0pt;}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 18pt;"><br></span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">各单位：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">根据《关于开展<span lang="EN-US">2023</span>年校级教学成果奖（本科）申报评选工作的通知》（本字〔<span lang="EN-US">2023</span>〕<span lang="EN-US">136</span>号）精神，学校开展了<span lang="EN-US">2023</span>年校级教学成果奖的申报和评审工作。本次评审共收到申报项目<span lang="EN-US">57</span>项，经专家评审、学校研究，评选出特等奖<span lang="EN-US">8</span>项，一等奖<span lang="EN-US">13</span>项，二等奖<span lang="EN-US">13</span>项。特等奖和一等奖中拟推荐<span lang="EN-US">12</span>项申报省级教学成果奖，学校还将从教指委等渠道积极推荐优秀成果。现将评审结果予以公示（按获奖等级和学院次序排序）。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">公示时间为<span lang="EN-US">2023</span>年<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">23</span>日至<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">27</span>日。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">请各项目组认真核对有关信息，若有异议，请联系：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">本科生院教研科：南校区办公楼二层<span lang="EN-US">201</span>室</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">联系电话：<span lang="EN-US">81891764<a name="_GoBack"></a></span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">E</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">－<span lang="EN-US">mail</span>：<span lang="EN-US">jyk@xidian.edu.cn</span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">西安电子科技大学</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2023</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">23</span>日</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <div align="center">
  <table width="671" class="MsoTableGrid" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 503.25pt; border-collapse: collapse;">
   <tbody>
    <tr class="firstRow" style="height: 23.55pt;">
     <td width="671" nowrap colspan="6" style="padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 503.25pt; height: 23.55pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 12pt;">2023</span></strong><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 12pt;">年校级高等教育教学成果奖拟获奖名单</span></strong></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="height: 50.1pt;">
     <td width="47" style="border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border-image: none; width: 35.45pt; height: 50.1pt;"><p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋;">序号</span></strong></p></td>
     <td width="208" style="border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0cm 5.4pt; width: 155.85pt; height: 50.1pt;"><p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋;">项目名称</span></strong></p></td>
     <td width="190" style="border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0cm 5.4pt; width: 142.5pt; height: 50.1pt;"><p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋;">主要完成人</span></strong></p></td>
     <td width="90" style="border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0cm 5.4pt; width: 67.5pt; height: 50.1pt;"><p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋;">主要完成单位</span></strong></p></td>
